or T staging? Abdom Radiol. 2022;47:2739-2746. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 186. Bos P, Martens RM, de Graaf P, et al. External validation of an MR-based radiomic model predictive of locoregional control in oropharyngeal cancer. Eur Radiol. 2023;33:2850-2860. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 187. Bodalal Z, Wamelink I, Trebeschi S, Beets-Tan RGH. Radiomics in immuno-oncology. Immunooncol Technol. 2021;9:100028. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 188. Bodalal Z, Bogveradze N, Ter Beek LC, et al. Radiomic signatures from T2W and DWI MRI are predictive of tumour hypoxia in colorectal liver metastases. Insights Imaging. 2023;14:133. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 189. Khalili N, Kazerooni AF, Familiar A, et al. Radiomics for characterization of the glioma immune microenvironment. NPJ Precis Oncol. 2023;7:59. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 190. Wang JH, Wahid KA, van Dijk LV, Farahani K, Thompson RF, Fuller CD. Radiomic biomarkers of tumor immune biology and immunotherapy response. Clin Transl Radiat Oncol. 2021;28:97-115. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 191. Ortiz-Ramón R, Larroza A, Ruiz-España S, Arana E, Moratal D. Classifying brain metastases by their primary site of origin using a radiomics approach based on texture analysis: a feasibility study. Eur Radiol. 2018;28:4514-4523. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 192. Tomita H, Yamashiro T, Iida G, Tsubakimoto M, Mimura H, Murayama S. Radiomics analysis for differentiating of cervical lymphadenopathy between cancer of unknown primary and malignant lymphoma on unenhanced computed tomography. Nagoya J Med Sci. 2022;84:269-285. [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 193. Ishiwata Y, Kaneta T, Nawata S, Iizuka H, Utsunomiya D. Feasibility of prognosis assessment for cancer of unknown primary origin using texture analysis of 18F-fluorodeoxyglucose PET/computed tomography images of