INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(4158,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC8021228','Pioneer women in the development of toxicology in Brazil.','Melo L, Melo TS.','2021','celebrate berlanga aparecida matta chasin gisela aragao umbuzeiro tania marcourakis admirable adversities broke goddess poisoners sbtox uniting manaus sbtox costal sbtox medal bastos siqueira berlanga aparecida matta chasin sbtox celebrates broke celebrated regina paraibuna linneu prestes bromatological bromatological chemist jockey linneu prestes dynamism humble chemist chemist doping jockey doping racing chemists aorc doping doping butanta glassware resigned doping jockey rdidp dreamt jockey doping jockey vials rdidp courage rewarded equated dictatorship doping doping volleyball championship championship volleyball championship fencing championship silvestre stricto sensu commendation honored nilda fernicola rywka sznelwar medal idol conquer tiaft chasin affection regina 13b commemorative berlanga xix dante alighieri admiration fascinated coincidentally coincidence drawers aflatoxin durval aflatoxin setbacks adayr saliba hexachlorocyclohexane hexachlorocyclohexane hch rattus rattus norvegicus professorships salib hexachlorocyclohexane rattus rattus norvegicus sbtox junqueira sbtox sbtox sbtox impressed internationalization iutox hadn immeasurable fapesp jecfa medal bstox aparecida matta chasin italians housewife fortress matriarch grandmother chasin chasin chasin insisted coup prosecuted punished defending goulart eagerly fascinated unesp iml iml irene videira pretending irene stairs hopeless flavio midio honorable idols aparecida pouchet despaired despair embarrassed skipped courage comforted forensics pouchet oswaldo foc cocaethylene foltz vina spiehler tough tough spiehler opera lover foltz spiehler docile funny iml iml foc sexism pouchet lately bstox sbtox presidency sbtox anvisa warrior foc tiaft bstox aafs narcotics medal generosity inspires regrets gisela aragao umbuzeiro gisela campinas gis